<TextPage title="Privacy Policy" eyebrow="Policies" placeholder>
  <p>This policy will describe what we collect and why:</p>
  <ul>
    <li>Order details and shipping addresses, to fulfill purchases. Payments are processed by Stripe; we never see or store card numbers.</li>
    <li>Booking details and the minimal intake information you choose to share, to prepare for your consultation.</li>
    <li>Your email address, if you join our newsletter. You can unsubscribe at any time.</li>
    <li>Your basket is stored in your browser's local storage on your device.</li>
  </ul>
  <p>We don't sell your information. Questions: <a href="mailto:privacy@thedivinevine.org">privacy@thedivinevine.org</a>.</p>
</TextPage>
